# Doubao Seed Evolving — findings by Flint

- Source: ByteDance Seed / Volcengine Ark (`bytedance/doubao-seed-evolving`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Doubao Seed Evolving
- **Short description:** ByteDance Seed's continuously updated agentic coding / office model, served under the unified `bytedance/doubao-seed-evolving` model ID as the "Evolving" line of the Seed2.1 family (Pro / Turbo lineage) optimized for coding, office work and productivity enhancement, integrated into ByteDance's Volcano Agent Plan with weekly capability updates.
- **Provider / access:** ByteDance Seed / Volcengine Ark — API model ID `bytedance/doubao-seed-evolving` (Ark, unified Evolving ID); Chat API + Responses API; deep thinking enabled by default (reasoning_effort default high).
- **Release / knowledge:** Seed2.1 family released 2026-06-23; the Evolving serving line tracks weekly updates on the unified ID; knowledge cutoff not established.
- **IDs:** `bytedance/doubao-seed-evolving` (unified Evolving ID) / lineage to the Seed2.1 Pro (`doubao-seed-2.1-pro-260915`) and Turbo (`doubao-seed-2.1-turbo-260628`) checkpoints.
- **Context window:** ~256,000 tokens context (ZenMux / modelbenchmark.io); max output 256K per one source vs 128K per another (HopBase) — conflicting values, not cleanly verified for this ID.
- **Modalities:** Text in / text out; multimodal understanding (image, video) plus coding / office agentic use; deep thinking (reasoning).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** same price tier as Seed2.1 Pro ≈ $0.89 input / $4.45 output per 1M tokens (Ark / Volcengine); cache read ≈ $0.18 / 1M; free on volcengine-coding-plan; paid on Ark.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; serving variant within the Seed2.1 family.

